---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Movement — Sanmarg : Aparajita" description="Movement — Aparajita, an initiative by Sanmarg.">
<section>
        <div class="container sec-pad">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                       <span class="inside-header">
                           <h1>Movement</h1>
                       </span>
                   </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
<section class="sec-pad grad-bg">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-9 mx-auto">
                    <p class="text-center intro-text quote-font">We all visualise ‘<b>a person in power</b>’ very differently. Our conventional markers of power are typically money, status or physical strength &#8211; yet <b>Aparajita</b> has always believed that true power is in quiet determination. It’s in <b>unselfish, unconditional giving</b>. It’s in <b>making an impact</b> on people, societies and the world for the sole reason of doing good.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec-pad">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-6 mx-auto mb-4">
                   <img src="/images/2.webp" width="100%" height="350" alt="Section Image" style="object-fit: cover;">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row d-flex align-items-center sec-pad">
                <div class="col-sm-4 mob-img">
                    <img src="/images/movment-motif.webp" alt="Movment" class="img-fluid mb-3">
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-8">
                    <p>Aparajita was founded for women who underplay their achievements. For those who may not realise and own the true impact of their work. From celebrating the cultural and professional excellence of women of all ages to finding measurable ways to support our community, Aparajita’s work has evolved with time, yet her soul has always stood for the singular purpose of honouring the quiet power in every woman’s indomitable spirit.<br><br>
                    She brings their dreams to life in tangible ways. She helps them realise the growth they imagine for themselves and extends support to their good purpose. Aparajita is she who does not make herself small to fit the world around her.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-12 content-gap">
                    <div class="row d-flex align-items-center">
                        <div class="col-sm-8 odr-mob">
                            <p>To be fair to the intricacy and delicacy of her process, Aparajita has partnered with Ernst and Young, leveraging their expertise to guarantee transparent nominations, fair tabulations, and the selection of her jury and winners.</p>
                            <p>Aparajita&#8217;s commitment extends beyond mere recognition—it is about ensuring that women feel heard and seen, acknowledging their credit and ownership, and fostering a shared collection of resources. Aparajita uplifts ambitious women, cherishing the prayers and blessings exchanged by both sides along the way.</p>
                            <p>No Aparajita diminishes herself to fit societal norms; instead, she stands tall and proud, embracing her achievements and empowering others to do the same. With Aparajita, it&#8217;s not just about celebrating success—it&#8217;s about fostering a community where every woman&#8217;s potential is realised, and her contributions are valued.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-4 mob-img">
                            <img src="/images/movment-teaser2.webp" class="img-fluid img-left" alt="Movment">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Base>
